# Push branch 2.1 to `antony` only

Production VPS deploys from **Tony's repo**: `https://github.com/antonyanbu25/lionpath_V2.git` (remote name **`antony`**).

## Rules

- On branch **`2.1`**, push **only** to **`antony`**, not **`origin`** (`skut264/lionpath`).
- Local **`2.1`** tracks **`antony/2.1`** (upstream). Do not re-point it to `origin/2.1`.
- Do **not** change global git config; branch-level upstream is sufficient.

## Commands

```bash
git checkout 2.1
git push antony 2.1
```

After pushing, VPS should fetch from `antonyanbu25/lionpath_V2` (see README Deploy / `docs/VPS_DEPLOY.md`).

## Do not

- `git push origin 2.1` for release/deploy purposes on this branch
- Assume pushes to `origin` update the VPS
